## Requirements and Installation

> **Compatibility:** This project currently supports Windows 10 and Windows 11 only.

### Requirements

- Python 3.12
- Microphone and speakers
- Internet connection
- Ollama
- Tesseract OCR

### 1. Install Python Libraries

Open the project folder in the VS Code terminal and run:

```powershell
python -m pip install customtkinter feedparser mss numpy ollama psutil PyAutoGUI PyAudio pyperclip pytesseract requests screen-brightness-control SpeechRecognition Pillow pywin32 pystray edge-tts
```

### 2. Install Ollama

Download Ollama from [ollama.com/download/windows](https://ollama.com/download/windows), then run:

```powershell
ollama pull qwen3:8b
ollama pull qwen2.5vl:7b
```

Keep Ollama running while using Jarvis.

### 3. Install Tesseract OCR

Run:

```powershell
winget install --exact --id UB-Mannheim.TesseractOCR
```

Tesseract must be installed at:

```text
C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR\tesseract.exe
```

### 4. Run Jarvis

```powershell
python jarvis.py
```

Replace `jarvis.py` with the actual name of the Python file if it is different.
